":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-14T20:26:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T19:51:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122428","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122428.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122428.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe existing CharacterBody3D movement template provides basic movement, gravity, and jumping, but there is no template that includes basic mouse camera controls.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new CharacterBody3D template with basic mouse-look functionality.\r\n\r\nThe template allows users to:\r\n\r\nRotate the character horizontally using mouse movement.\r\nRotate the camera vertically using mouse movement.\r\nLimit vertical camera rotation to prevent unnatural rotation.\r\nCapture the mouse when the game starts.\r\nAdjust mouse sensitivity.\r\n\r\nThis provides a more complete starting point for FPS/TPS-style 3D projects without requiring users to implement basic mouse camera controls themselves.\r\n\r\nAdditional information\r\n\r\nThe camera is expected to be a Camera3D child of the CharacterBody3D.\r\n\r\nThe template was written from scratch and tested in Godot to verify the movement, jumping, mouse-look, and mouse capture behavior.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122428/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":1,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":3,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122428/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}